OL,3,GNEWSAYour photos: Autumn colours and
OL,4,Adramatic skies
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe love sharing your photographs
OL,7,Fshowcasing the West Midlands at its
OL,8,Fseasonal best.
OL,10,FThis week, our photographers have
OL,11,Fcaptured autumn's golden colours,
OL,12,Fdramatic sunsets, sunlit landscapes and
OL,13,Fmisty countryside scenes from across
OL,14,Fthe region.
OL,16,FYou can be part of future galleries
OL,17,Fwith your own photos of the area -
OL,18,Fupload your images via BBC Weather
OL,19,FWatchers or email us at
OL,20,Fmidlandstoday@bbc.co.uk.
